      "blocks": {
        "faq_heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Birthday hampers for her, packed by hand</h2><p>Every Bow &amp; Bloom hamper is packed by hand in Yorkshire, wrapped in pink tissue and tied with a satin bow. Inside there's a pamper night, cosy extras and something sweet, so it suits a best friend, a sister, a partner or your mum.</p><p>Delivery is free and tracked on every UK order, and the gift message is free too.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
